SUMMARY:Twin Falls loop\, 7 miles
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Twin Falls Loop**\nMileage: appr
 ox 7 miles\nElevation gain: 800’\nDifficultly: moderate\nSpeed: 2-2.5 mp
 h\n\nWe’ll meet at the Pisgah Ranger station at 8:45 for a 9:00 sharp de
 parture. We’ll car pool to the Buckhorn Gap trailhead. The hike will sta
 rt on Buckhorn Gap\, turn onto Avery Creek trail to Clawhammer. Head up Cl
 awhammer to Clawhammer road and back up to Buckhorn Gap. Coming down Buckh
 orn Gap we will turn onto the Twin Falls trail\, stopping at the falls for
  lunch/snack. Return to Buckhorn Gap trailhead and back to the cars.\n\nIf
  you would rather meet at the trailhead please let a comment. We should be
  starting the hike at 9:15 from the trailhead.\n\nDogs are welcome. I will
  have my dog with me.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/317175679
 /
